            </note>
            <note corresp="#d352-f5" n="5" xml:id="d352-f5-content">
                <p>For premature releases concerning the Tehran Conference, see <hi
                        rendition="#italic">post</hi>, <ref target="#pg641">pp. 641</ref> ff.</p>
            </note>
